# QMIE trading-agent boundary

- No order execution, broker adapters, HyperLiquid API wallets, or Signum bots.
- No Hermes / OpenClaw install. No `npx` MCP servers. Prefer Runlayer if an MCP is ever required.
- TradingView = `pine/quant_visualizer.pine` + `tv_chart_url()`. There is no TV HTTP trading API here.
- Strategy changes: one variable per review cycle. Update `strategy/baseline.yaml` only when a human applies the matching `.env` knob.
- Pine parity: if you touch `scanner/indicators.py` or `scanner/signal_engine.py`, change the Pine file in the same commit.
